sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 沙盒進程 (User code)
    participant K as Linux Kernel<br/>(Seccomp BPF)
    participant M as Rust Monitor
    participant DB as SQLite WAL
    participant FB as feedback.rs

    U->>K: syscall e.g. socket(AF_INET, ...)
    K->>K: BPF filter 評估 nr
    alt 規則 = ALLOW
        K-->>U: 直接放行 (fast path)
    else 規則 = NOTIFY
        K->>K: 暫停 syscall, 建立 seccomp_notif
        K-->>M: notify_fd 變為可讀
        M->>K: ioctl(SECCOMP_IOCTL_NOTIF_RECV)
        K-->>M: SeccompNotif{id, pid, data{nr, args[6]}}
        M->>FB: lookup(syscall_name)
        FB-->>M: {action, errno, semantic_zh/en, hint}
        M->>DB: INSERT INTO syscall_events
        M->>K: ioctl(SECCOMP_IOCTL_NOTIF_SEND<br/>{id, val=0, error=-EACCES})
        K-->>U: syscall 返回 errno (進程不死)
    end
